        A Saturday Skirmish or Mission is the straightforward backyard birthday. Campaign and the full days are the longer blocks. Weeknights use the Monday–Thursday price on those same packages. Harker Heights, Nolanville, Copperas Cove, Belton, and Kempner stay free, inside 30 miles. Temple is the 31–45 mile band at $50, and a pin at 30 miles or under is still free.
